## ⚠️ Gaps & Missing Features (1.5 pts to gain)

### Gap 1: Data Binding (HIGH PRIORITY) — 0.5 pts
**Current**: Cards are static, no real data  
**Required**: Bind to AuctionSession, Bid models  
**Action**:
```java
// ProductCard should bind to AuctionSession
@FXML private Label lblPrice, lblTimeRemaining;
private AuctionSession session;

public void setAuctionSession(AuctionSession session) {
    this.session = session;
    lblPrice.setText(String.format("$%.2f", session.getCurrentPrice()));
    // Update on price change
}
```

### Gap 2: Anti-sniping UI (MEDIUM PRIORITY) — 0.25 pts
**Current**: Logic in AntiSnipingTest, not in UI  
**Required**: Show time warning, auto-extend notification  
**Action**:
```java
// In BidderDashboard, show warning when < 5 min left
if (timeRemaining < 300) {
    lblWarning.setText("⚠️ Auction ending soon!");
    lblWarning.setStyle("-fx-text-fill: red;");
}
```

### Gap 3: Bid History Chart (MEDIUM PRIORITY) — 0.5 pts
**Current**: Not implemented  
**Required**: Line chart showing price over time  
**Action**:
```java
// Use JavaFX LineChart
LineChart<Number, Number> chart = new LineChart<>(xAxis, yAxis);
XYChart.Series<Number, Number> series = new XYChart.Series<>();
for (Bid bid : bidHistory) {
    series.getData().add(new XYChart.Data<>(bid.getTime().getTime(), bid.getAmount()));
}
chart.getData().add(series);
```

### Gap 4: Protocol Integration (HIGH PRIORITY) — 0.5 pts
**Current**: Controllers not calling backend  
**Required**: Wire all protocol methods  
**Action**:
```java
// In BidderDashboard
List<AuctionSession> auctions = protocol.getActiveAuctions();
for (AuctionSession auction : auctions) {
    ProductCard card = new ProductCard();
    card.setAuctionSession(auction);
    containerAuctions.getChildren().add(card);
}
```

### Gap 5: Real-time Listeners (MEDIUM PRIORITY) — 0.25 pts
**Current**: No listeners for server push  
**Required**: Listen to PRICE_UPDATE, BID_PLACED messages  
**Action**:
```java
// In RealtimeAuctionBus
public void onPriceUpdate(Message msg) {
    AuctionSession session = (AuctionSession) msg.getData();
    // Update all cards showing this session
    updateCardPrice(session.getId(), session.getCurrentPrice());
}
```

